+# UA Human Layout Patch
+
+## Baseline
+
+- Upstream: https://github.com/Egonex-AI/Understand-Anything
+- Tag: `v2.9.0`
+- Commit: `f08763d11d0202a8a8f52b5dedda6d1b2e2ebac8`
+- Local branch: `local/human-layout-v2.9.0`
+- License: MIT
+
+## Purpose
+
+Make structural graphs easier to read without changing the knowledge-graph schema or analysis pipeline. The patch treats graphs with 20 or fewer visible nodes as human-scale semantic diagrams and preserves the upstream lazy container path for larger graphs.
+
+## Behavior
+
+- `0..20` visible nodes: no folder/community containers; compact left-to-right ELK layout.
+- `21+` visible nodes: unchanged upstream folder/community derivation, edge aggregation, and lazy Stage 2 layout.
+- Flat and overview graphs label edges with relationship types instead of meaningless singleton counts.
+- Hover or keyboard focus keeps the node, its one-hop neighbors, and direct parent/children visible; unrelated nodes and edges fade without relayout. Diff mode disables this overlay so change semantics remain authoritative.
+- React Flow wrapper focus is disabled; each visible graph card exposes one keyboard focus target with Enter/Space activation and an aria-label.
+- Dark themes use stronger node borders and a higher-contrast container surface.
+- Overview cards report `nodes`, not `files`, because semantic projections can contain concepts and modules.
+
+## Build And Test
+
+```bash
+corepack pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
+corepack pnpm --filter @understand-anything/core build
+corepack pnpm --filter @understand-anything/dashboard test
+corepack pnpm --filter @understand-anything/dashboard build
+corepack pnpm exec eslint understand-anything-plugin/packages/dashboard/src
+```
+
+The standalone local artifact combines the official v2.9.0 token-gated `viewer.mjs` with the rebuilt dashboard `dist/`:
+
+```text
+.run/ua-human-viewer/v2.9.0-human-20/
+```
+
+Run it with:
+
+```bash
+UNDERSTAND_ACCESS_TOKEN=<token> node .run/ua-human-viewer/v2.9.0-human-20/bin/viewer.mjs <project-dir> --port 5176 --no-open
+```
+
+## Hermes Acceptance Evidence
+
+Architecture Bundle:
+
+- 6 overview nodes, 8 edges.
+- `智能体与任务`: 7 semantic objects plus 2 cross-layer portals.
+- 0 folder/community containers in the drill-in view.
+- 6 internal `contains` edge labels.
+- Hover and keyboard focus both kept 4 one-hop objects visible and faded 5 unrelated objects; the focused node exposes a role and Chinese aria-label.
+
+Full Bundle:
+
+- 8,864 nodes, 20,604 edges, 11 layers loaded.
+- Large `服务端能力与协议适配` layer retained community containers.
+- Fuzzy search found `electron/main.cjs` at 100%.
+- Source preview endpoint returned 417 lines / 11,357 bytes.
+- Invalid token returned 403; unlisted source path returned 404.
+
+Screenshots and CDP capture harness are under `.run/ua-human-viewer/`.
+
+## Boundaries
+
+- This patch does not merge the Architecture and Full bundles into one URL.
+- It does not modify cbm2ua structural facts, semantic overlays, path finding, or source allowlists.
+- The official standalone server remains the security boundary for graph and source access.
